    <string name="profile_parse">Parse</string>
    <string name="profile_tables_note">Offset tables shipped inside the APK. Pick any of them instead of the automatic match with this device\'s kernel; the one you pick is what Run uses.</string>
    <string name="profile_parse_note">Struct offsets come from BTF, symbol addresses from kallsyms. Run tuning is taken from the closest bundled profile. An OTA zip or payload.bin works directly: the boot partition is pulled out in place, without unpacking the whole package. MTK builds: boot.img + (vendor_boot.img may be attached); the kernel is taken from whichever file holds it.</string>
    <string name="profile_ota_note">Or paste an OTA link: a full OTA zip, a payload.bin, or a boot.img. Only the byte ranges the parser needs are downloaded, so the server must honor HTTP Range. Delta OTAs are refused. Use https:// - cleartext HTTP is blocked on Android 9 and newer.</string>
    <string name="profile_portable_note">Offsets are portable: export the parsed values to a JSON file, or import one without re-reading the boot image. The file records where each field came from; files carrying borrowed absolute addresses are refused.</string>
    <string name="profile_reading">Reading %1$s…</string>
    <string name="profile_verify_note">A profile with wrong offsets fails the run instead of gaining root. Treat a new profile as unverified until one run succeeds.</string>
